### Register a new youth (student)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/youth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Mal",
  "email": "john.mal@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "communityType": "refugee",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-01-15",
  "gender": "male",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678"
}

### Login youth
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/youth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.mal@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

